    "Bir cihaza dokununca panelin kontrol ekran\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r; ekranda yaln\u0131zca o cihaz\u0131n destekledi\u011fi \u00f6zellikler g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Shelly, WLED ve ESPHome cihazlar\u0131nda a\u00e7/kapat ve parlakl\u0131k do\u011frudan cihaza gider.": "Tapnite napravo, da odprete zaslon za upravljanje panela; prikazuje le funkcije, ki jih ta naprava podpira. Za naprave Shelly, WLED in ESPHome gumb za vklop/izklop in svetlost neposredno nadzoruje napravo.", // EN: Tap a device to open the panel's control screen; it shows only the features that device supports. For Shelly, WLED and ESPHome devices, on/off and brightness go straight to the device.
    "Bir eve kat\u0131l ekran\u0131nda bu kod kullan\u0131l\u0131r.": "Ta koda se uporablja na zaslonu Pridru\u017eite se domu.", // EN: This code is used on the Join a Home screen.
