    "Bu 8 haneli kod Apple HomeKit e\u015fle\u015ftirmesi i\u00e7indir ve yaln\u0131zca Apple Ev uygulamas\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Cihaz Shelly, WLED, Tasmota gibi yerel API destekliyorsa yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Ta 8-mestna koda je za parjenje Apple HomeKit in deluje le z aplikacijo Apple Home. \u010ce naprava podpira lokalni API, kot so Shelly, WLED ali Tasmota, jo lahko dodate iz lokalnega omre\u017eja.", // EN: This 8-digit code is for Apple HomeKit pairing and only works with the Apple Home app. If the device supports a local API such as Shelly, WLED or Tasmota, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu Cihaz": "Ta naprava", // EN: This Device
    "Bu QR kodu bir Wi-Fi a\u011f\u0131na aittir, cihaz de\u011fildir. Cihaz\u0131 ayn\u0131 a\u011fa ba\u011flad\u0131ktan sonra yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Ta QR koda pripada Wi-Fi omre\u017eju, ne napravi. Po povezavi naprave na isto omre\u017eje, jo lahko dodate iz va\u0161ega lokalnega omre\u017eja.", // EN: This QR code belongs to a Wi-Fi network, not a device. After connecting the device to the same network, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu adreste bilinen bir NEXUS cihaz\u0131 bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n ayn\u0131 a\u011fda ve a\u00e7\u0131k oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Ni bila najdena nobena znana naprava NEXUS na tem naslovu. Prepri\u010dajte se, da je naprava vklopljena in na istem omre\u017eju.", // EN: No known NEXUS device was found at this address. Make sure the device is on and on the same network.
    "Bu ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulamay\u0131 olu\u015ftur:": "Ustvarite to pametno aplikacijo:", // EN: Create this smart app:
    "Bu ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7in \u00f6nerilen \u00f6zellikler haz\u0131rlan\u0131yor.": "Priprava predlaganih funkcij za ta tok.", // EN: Preparing suggested features for this flow.
    "Bu ayki tasarruf": "Shranjeno ta mesec", // EN: Saved this month
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131.": "Na tem omre\u017eju ni bila najdena nobena podprta naprava.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network.
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da oldu\u011fundan emin ol; olmazsa a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan katalo\u011fu ya da QR / kurulum kodunu kullan.": "Na tem omre\u017eju ni bila najdena nobena podprta naprava. Prepri\u010dajte se, da je naprava vklopljena in povezana na isto Wi-Fi; sicer uporabite spodnji katalog ali QR / namestitveno kodo.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network. Make sure the device is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi; otherwise use the catalog below or a QR / setup code.
    "Bu cihaz i\u00e7in yerel koruma": "Lokalna za\u0161\u010dita za to napravo", // EN: Local protection for this device
