    "Bu davet kodu bulunamad\u0131.": "Ta koda za vabilo ni bila najdena.", // EN: This invite code wasn't found.
    "Bu ekran, ekledi\u011fin ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 odalara g\u00f6re toplar; sahne kaydetti\u011finde \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n parlakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve tonu birlikte ayarlan\u0131r.": "Ta zaslon zdru\u017euje osvetlitvene naprave, ki ste jih dodali, po sobah; ko shranite prizor, se svetlost in ton nastavljata skupaj.", // EN: This screen groups the lighting devices you've added by room; when you save a scene, brightness and tone are set together.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir.": "Naprave, ki jih dodate v to hi\u0161o, so tukaj navedene.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir ve favori kartlar\u0131na ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Naprave, ki jih dodate v to hi\u0161o, so tukaj navedene in povezane z va\u0161imi priljubljenimi karticami.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here and linked to your favorite cards.
    "Bu evi ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silmek istedi\u011fine emin misin?": "Ali ste prepri\u010dani, da \u017eelite trajno izbrisati to hi\u0161o in vse njene nastavitve?", // EN: Are you sure you want to permanently delete this home and all its settings?
    "Bu kod desteklenen bir cihaz kodu de\u011fil. Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini biliyorsan yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Ta koda ni podprta koda naprave. \u010ce poznate IP naslov naprave, jo lahko dodate iz lokalnega omre\u017eja.", // EN: This code isn't a supported device code. If you know the device's IP address, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu markalar yerel a\u011fdan kontrol edilir": "Te blagovne znamke se upravljajo prek va\u0161ega lokalnega omre\u017eja.", // EN: These brands are controlled over your local network
    "Bu mini uygulama resm\u00ee sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan sunulur.": "Ta mini aplikacija je zagotovljena s strani uradnega ponudnika.", // EN: This mini app is provided by the official provider.
    "Bu ortam kamera eri\u015fimini desteklemiyor.": "To okolje ne podpira dostopa do kamere.", // EN: This environment doesn't support camera access.
    "Bu ortamda a\u011f taramas\u0131 kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor.": "Omre\u017eno skeniranje tukaj ni na voljo.", // EN: Network scanning isn't available here.
    "Bu ortamda g\u00fcvenli \u015fifreleme yok": "V tem okolju ni varnega \u0161ifriranja.", // EN: No secure encryption in this environment
    "Bu senaryo aktifle\u015fti\u011finde ilgili cihazlar otomatik olarak ayarlan\u0131r.": "Ko se ta scenarij za\u017eene, se pripadajo\u010de naprave samodejno prilagodijo.", // EN: When this scenario runs, the related devices are adjusted automatically.
    "Bu senaryodan etkilenen cihaz yok \u2014 \u00f6nce uygun cihaz ekle.": "Nobenih naprav ta scenarij ne vpliva \u2014 najprej dodajte ustrezno napravo.", // EN: No devices are affected by this scenario — add a suitable device first.
    "Bu senaryoyu kullanmak i\u00e7in uyumlu cihaz eklemelisin.": "Za uporabo tega scenarija morate dodati zdru\u017eljivo napravo.", // EN: You need to add a compatible device to use this scenario.
    "Bu tek evin. Silersen bo\u015f bir \"Evim\" yeniden olu\u015fturulur. Devam edilsin mi?": "To je va\u0161 edini dom. \u010ce ga izbri\u0161ete, bo znova ustvarjen prazen \u00bbMoj dom\u00ab. Nadaljujem?", // EN: This is your only home. If you delete it, an empty "My Home" will be created again. Continue?
