    "Cihazlar\u0131na dair i\u00e7g\u00f6r\u00fcler edin, stratejilerle otomatik tasarruf et.": "Pridobite vpoglede o svojih napravah in samodejno var\u010dujte s strategijami.", // EN: Get insights about your devices and save automatically with strategies.
    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 otomatik tarama, QR kod, kurulum kodu ya da manuel katalog ile ekleyebilirsin.": "Naprav lahko dodate s samodejnim skeniranjem, QR kodo, namestitveno kodo ali ro\u010dnim katalogom.", // EN: You can add your devices with automatic scan, QR code, setup code or the manual catalog.
