    "Cihaz\u0131m neden \u00e7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcyor?": "Zakaj moja naprava prikazuje stanje brez povezave?", // EN: Why does my device show as offline?
    "Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini yaz, NEXUS konu\u015fabildi\u011fi protokol\u00fc kendisi anlas\u0131n.": "Vnesite IP naslov naprave in NEXUS ugotovi, kateri protokol uporablja.", // EN: Type the device's IP address and NEXUS figures out which protocol it speaks.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "Preverite Wi-Fi povezavo naprave in va\u0161 usmerjevalnik. \u010ce te\u017eava vztraja, odstranite napravo in jo dodajte znova. Koraki: Naprave > izberite napravo > Odstrani.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "Preverite Wi-Fi povezavo naprave in va\u0161 usmerjevalnik. \u010ce te\u017eava vztraja, odstranite napravo iz aplikacije NEXUS in jo dodajte znova.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "\u010ce se va\u0161a naprava ne prika\u017ee, uporabite skeniranje QR ali namestitveno kodo. Za podporo in navodila lahko odprete stran za pomo\u010d.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum (GPS) servisi kapal\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131p tekrar dene.": "Storitev za dolo\u010danje lokacije (GPS) na va\u0161i napravi je izklopljena. Vklopite jo in poskusite znova.", // EN: Your device's location (GPS) service is off. Turn it on and try again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum servisini desteklemiyor.": "Va\u0161a naprava ne podpira storitev za dolo\u010danje lokacije.", // EN: Your device doesn't support location services.
