    "Eve geldim": "Dobrodo\u0161el doma", // EN: Welcome home
    "Eve vard\u0131\u011f\u0131nda veya evden ayr\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Ko pride\u0161 domov ali odide\u0161", // EN: When you arrive home or leave
    "Eve yakla\u015f\u0131rken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 a\u00e7, klimay\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r ve garaj kap\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 arac\u0131n\u0131n ekran\u0131ndan kontrol et.": "Vklopite lu\u010di, za\u017eenite klimatsko napravo in upravljajte gara\u017ena vrata s zaslona svojega avtomobila, ko se pribli\u017eujete domu.", // EN: Turn on the lights, start the AC and control the garage door from your car's screen as you approach home.
    "Evet, Uygula": "Da, Uporabi", // EN: Yes, Apply
    "Evet, \u0130ptal Et": "Da, Prekli\u010di", // EN: Yes, Cancel
    "Evet. NEXUS yerel \u00f6ncelikli \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r; cihaz verilerin bu cihazda kal\u0131r ve \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraflarla payla\u015f\u0131lmaz.": "Da. NEXUS temelji na pristopu lokalno-prvo; podatki va\u0161e naprave ostanejo na tej napravi in niso deljeni s tretjimi osebami.", // EN: Yes. NEXUS is local-first; your device data stays on this device and isn't shared with third parties.
