    "NEXUS i\u00e7inde \"Bir Eve Kat\u0131l\" alan\u0131na bu kodu girerek kat\u0131labilirsin.": "Pridru\u017eite se lahko tako, da v NEXUS vnesete to kodo v \"Pridru\u017ei se domu\".", // EN: You can join by entering this code in "Join a Home" inside NEXUS.
    "NEXUS senaryolar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 Siri komutlar\u0131yla saniyeler i\u00e7inde sesle \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n.": "Za\u017eenite svoje NEXUS scenarije z glasom s Siri v nekaj sekundah.", // EN: Run your NEXUS scenarios by voice with Siri in seconds.
    "NEXUS yerel \u00f6ncelikli \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r: cihaz verilerin bu cihazda kal\u0131r, cihaz komutlar\u0131 do\u011frudan yerel a\u011fdan gider ve \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraflarla payla\u015f\u0131lmaz.": "NEXUS postavlja lokalno na prvo mesto: podatki va\u0161ih naprav ostanejo na tej napravi, ukazi naprav gredo neposredno po lokalnem omre\u017eju, in ni\u010d ne deli s tretjimi osebami.", // EN: NEXUS is local-first: your device data stays on this device, device commands go straight over your local network, and nothing is shared with third parties.
