    "Bu adreste bir cihaz var ama NEXUS protokol\u00fc konu\u015fmuyor.": "Na tem naslovu je naprava, vendar ne uporablja protokola NEXUS.", // EN: There is a device at this address, but it does not speak a NEXUS protocol.
    "Bu cihaz zaten ekli.": "Ta naprava je \u017ee dodana.", // EN: This device is already added.
    "E\u015fle\u015ftir ve ekle": "Pove\u017ei in dodaj", // EN: Pair and add
    "E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodu ge\u00e7ersiz. 11 haneli kodu ya da MT: ile ba\u015flayan QR i\u00e7eri\u011fini gir.": "Koda za povezavo ni veljavna. Vnesite 11-mestno kodo ali vsebino QR, ki se za\u010dne z MT:.", // EN: The pairing code is not valid. Enter the 11-digit code or the QR content that starts with MT:.
    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "To kodo vnesite v Namizno aplikacijo NEXUS. \u010ce je naprava na Wi-Fi, jo lahko dodate tudi iz lokalnega omre\u017eja po njenem IP naslovu.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "Naprava se i\u0161\u010de v istem omre\u017eju in se povezuje. To lahko traja do ene minute; naprava mora biti vklopljena in v na\u010dinu za povezovanje.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Naprava ni bila najdena ali je ni bilo mogo\u010de povezati. Prepri\u010dajte se, da je na istem omre\u017eju, vklopljena in v na\u010dinu za povezovanje.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "Naprava ni bila najdena. Prepri\u010dajte se, da je na istem omre\u017eju, vklopljena in v na\u010dinu za povezovanje. Po\u017earni zid va\u0161ega ra\u010dunalnika lahko blokira odgovore naprav v lokalnem omre\u017eju.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "Naprave ni bilo mogo\u010de povezati. Preverite kodo za povezovanje in ali je naprava v na\u010dinu za povezovanje.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "Naprava je bila povezana, vendar nima funkcije, ki bi jo NEXUS lahko nadzoroval.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Naprava ni odgovorila. Prepri\u010dajte se, da je vklopljena in na istem omre\u017eju.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
