    "Yatak odas\u0131": "Spalnica", // EN: Bedroom
    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce gerekli t\u00fcm ev kontrollerini tek merkezde topla. I\u015f\u0131k azaltma, rahats\u0131z etme, kilit kontrol\u00fc ve gece iklim ayarlar\u0131 tek ekranda y\u00f6netilsin.": "Zberite vse doma\u010de preglede, ki jih potrebujete pred spanjem, na enem mestu. Zatemnite lu\u010di, ne moti, preverite zaklepanje in nastavitve no\u010dnega podnebja na enem zaslonu.", // EN: Gather all the home checks you need before bed in one center. Dim lights, do not disturb, lock check and night climate settings on one screen.
    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce \u0131\u015f\u0131k, sessiz mod, kilit ve iklim ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir uykuya haz\u0131rl\u0131k merkezi olu\u015ftur. Son kontrol \u00f6zeti ve tek dokunu\u015f gece modu ekle.": "Ustvarite center za pripravo na spanje, ki upravlja lu\u010di, tihi na\u010din, zaklepe in klimo pred spanjem. Dodajte kon\u010dni povzetek preverjanja in enotapni no\u010dni na\u010din.", // EN: Create a bedtime preparation center that manages lights, quiet mode, locks and climate before bed. Add a final check summary and one-tap night mode.
