    "Bu ekran\u0131 iPhone'daki NEXUS uygulamas\u0131nda a\u00e7; senaryolar\u0131n a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da listelenir ve her biri i\u00e7in Siri kestirmesi kurabilirsin.": "Odprite ta zaslon v aplikaciji NEXUS na svojem iPhonu; va\u0161i prizori so navedeni spodaj in za vsakega lahko nastavite Siri bli\u017enjico.", // EN: Open this screen in the NEXUS app on your iPhone; your scenes are listed below and you can set up a Siri shortcut for each one.
    "1. Senaryo ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 kopyala": "1. Kopirajte povezavo do prizora", // EN: 1. Copy the scene link
