    "S\u0131cakl\u0131k, r\u00fczg\u00e2r ya da ya\u011f\u0131\u015f bir e\u015fi\u011fi ge\u00e7ti\u011finde": "Ko temperatura, veter ali de\u017e prese\u017ee prag", // EN: When temperature, wind or rain passes a threshold
    "T\u00fcm \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 a\u00e7": "Vklopi vse lu\u010di", // EN: Turn on all lights
