    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "Izklopi vsako lu\u010d.", // EN: Turns off every light.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta, g\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 tonunda a\u00e7ar.": "Vklopi lu\u010di na polno svetlost v dnevnem tonu.", // EN: Turns lights on at full brightness in a daylight tone.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %85 n\u00f6tr tona getirir, TV'yi kapat\u0131r.": "Nastavi lu\u010di na 85 % v nevtralnem tonu in izklopi TV.", // EN: Sets lights to 85% in a neutral tone and turns off the TV.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %40 s\u0131cak tona getirir.": "Nastavi lu\u010di na 40 % v toplem tonu.", // EN: Sets lights to 40% in a warm tone.
    "Her ak\u015fam 19:30": "Vsak ve\u010der ob 19:30", // EN: Every evening 19:30
    "Klimay\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131p 20\u00b0'ye, termostat\u0131 20\u00b0'ye ayarlar.": "Vklopi klimatsko napravo na 20\u00b0 in nastavi termostat na 20\u00b0.", // EN: Turns the AC on at 20° and sets the thermostat to 20°.
    "Termostat\u0131 24\u00b0 konfor ayar\u0131na getirir.": "Nastavi termostat na udobno nastavitev 24\u00b0.", // EN: Sets the thermostat to a 24° comfort setting.
