    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn bat\u0131m\u0131nda": "Vsak dan ob son\u010dnem zahodu", // EN: Every day at sunset
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn ak\u0131ll\u0131 kilitleri kilitler (kilit hi\u00e7bir zaman a\u00e7\u0131lmaz).": "Zaklene vse pametne klju\u010davnice (klju\u010davnice nikoli niso odklenjene).", // EN: Locks every smart lock (locks are never unlocked).
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r; prizlere ve klimaya dokunmaz.": "Izklopi lu\u010di in televizijo; vti\u010dnic in klimatske naprave ne posega.", // EN: Turns off lights and the TV; leaves plugs and the AC alone.
    "Bir cihaz\u0131 a\u00e7 ya da kapat": "Vklopi ali izklopi napravo", // EN: Turn a device on or off
