    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava kalitesini, s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve nemi g\u00f6r; ar\u0131t\u0131c\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6net.": "Ogled kakovosti zraka, temperature in vlage, ki jih merijo senzorji, in upravljanje \u010distilca zraka.", // EN: See the air quality, temperature and humidity your sensors measure, and control your purifier.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve klimay\u0131 g\u00fcne ba\u015flarken tek dokunu\u015fla haz\u0131rla.": "Pripravi lu\u010di, zavese in klimatsko napravo za dan z enim tapom.", // EN: Get lights, curtains and the AC ready for the day with one tap.
    "Eve girerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve iklimi birlikte a\u00e7.": "Vklopi lu\u010di, zavese in klimatizacijo hkrati, ko pride\u0161 domov.", // EN: Turn on lights, curtains and climate together when you get home.
    "Uzun s\u00fcre evde yokken cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00fcvenli ve tasarruflu konuma al.": "Postavi svoje naprave v varen, energijsko var\u010den na\u010din, medtem ko si dlje \u010dasa odsoten.", // EN: Put your devices into a safe, energy-saving state while you are away for long.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 k\u0131s, perdeleri kapat ve TV'yi a\u00e7.": "Zatemnite lu\u010di, zaprite zavese in vklopite televizor.", // EN: Dim the lights, close the curtains and turn on the TV.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeni ba\u015flat ya da \u015farj istasyonuna g\u00f6nder.": "Za\u017eenite svoj robotski sesalnik ali ga po\u0161ljite nazaj na polnilno postajo.", // EN: Start your robot vacuum or send it back to its dock.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitle, perdeleri kapat ve evi geceye haz\u0131rla.": "Zaklenite vrata, zaprite zavese in pripravite hi\u0161o na no\u010d.", // EN: Lock the door, close the curtains and get the house ready for the night.
    "Ekledi\u011fin kameralar\u0131n durumunu ve gizlilik ayar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6r.": "Ogledate si lahko stanje in nastavitve zasebnosti va\u0161ih kamer na enem zaslonu.", // EN: See the status and privacy setting of your cameras on one screen.
    "Evdeyken kameralar\u0131n i\u00e7in gizlilik modunu tek yerden a\u00e7 ya da kapat.": "Vklopite ali izklopite na\u010din zasebnosti za va\u0161e kamere na enem mestu, medtem ko ste doma.", // EN: Turn privacy mode for your cameras on or off from one place while you are home.
    "Bug\u00fcn hangi otomasyonun ne zaman \u00e7al\u0131\u015faca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6r.": "Ogledate si lahko, katera avtomatizacija se izvaja danes.", // EN: See which automation runs when today.
    "Ev halk\u0131yla notlar\u0131 ve yap\u0131lacaklar\u0131 payla\u015f.": "Deli opombe in opravila s svojo dru\u017eino.", // EN: Share notes and to-dos with your household.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava, nem ve s\u0131cakl\u0131ktan evinin sa\u011fl\u0131k \u00f6zetini g\u00f6r.": "Ogledate si lahko povzetek zdravja va\u0161e hi\u0161e glede na zrak, vlago in temperaturo, ki jo merijo va\u0161i senzorji.", // EN: See your home's health summary from the air, humidity and temperature your sensors measure.
    "Ekledi\u011fin cihazlar\u0131n yerel a\u011fdan ula\u015f\u0131labilir olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kontrol et.": "Preverite, ali je mogo\u010de dose\u010di va\u0161e naprave preko lokalnega omre\u017eja.", // EN: Check whether your devices can be reached over your local network.
