    "Bu hesap Google ile a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131, i\u00e7inde hen\u00fcz bir \u015fifre yok. \u0130lk \u015fifreni burada belirleyebilirsin; bundan sonra e-posta ve \u015fifreyle de giri\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Ta ra\u010dun je bil odprt z Googlom in \u0161e nima gesla. Nastavite svoje prvo geslo tukaj; po tem se lahko prijavite tudi z e-po\u0161to in geslom.", // EN: This account was opened with Google and has no password yet. Set your first password here; after that you can also sign in with email and password.
