    "Kritik uyar\u0131lar\u0131 payla\u015f": "Deli kriti\u010dna opozorila", // EN: Share critical alerts
    "Bu cihazdaki g\u00fcvenlik/acil olaylar\u0131n ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve k\u0131sa metni evdeki di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin uygulamas\u0131nda g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Cihaz bilgileri ve anahtarlar payla\u015f\u0131lmaz; her \u00fcye kendi bildirim ayarlar\u0131na tabidir.": "Naslov in kratek opis varnostnih/nujnih dogodkov na tej napravi se prikazujeta v aplikacijah drugih \u010dlanov v tem domu. Podrobnosti naprave in klju\u010di nikoli niso deljeni; vsak \u010dlan sledi svojim nastavitvam obve\u0161\u010danja.", // EN: The title and short text of security/emergency events on this device appear in other members' apps in this home. Device details and keys are never shared; every member follows their own notification settings.
